#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = čisti rubovi u veličini renderiranja igre. DLSS = isto, i povećava sliku kad je Skaliranje "
"igre ispod 100 %. Miks = TAA same igre pomiješan s DLAA / DLSS: mirnije, malo mekše. isključeno = "
"slika same igre. Sprema se odmah."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Koliko miksa čini TAA igre, 0 - 100 % u koracima od 10 %: više = mirnije i mekše, manje = "
"oštrije. Prikazuje se dok je Način Miks ili podjela ima stranu s miksom. Bez dodatnog troška."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Predlošci za vašu grafičku karticu. visoko = sve uključeno (model 1). srednje = model 2, lakši "
"ispravak stakla i ograda, retrovizori bez praćenja pokretnih dijelova. nisko = i bez glatkih "
"retrovizora, bez ispravka stakla i ograda, VR područje 60 %. Nikad ne mijenja postavku koju ste "
"sami postavili."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = najviše detalja, najoštriji tekst, oko 1,6x više GPU-a nego 2. 2 (E) = uravnotežen, "
"najmanje tragova iza prometa: počnite ovdje. 3 (F) = najmirniji na ogradama i žicama, može "
"razmazati pokretne detalje, ista cijena kao 2. 4 (M) = najzahtjevniji (oko 5x), samo za testove u "
"ravnom načinu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kvaliteta slike: oštrenje, oštrina tekstura, ispravak stakla i ograda, ispravak tragova svjetla i "
"DLAA područje. Desno otvara skupinu, lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je "
"zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Izoštrava sliku nakon DLAA, od 0 (isključeno) do 1.0. Povećajte ako je slika mutna; previsoko "
"daje svijetle oreole na rubovima. Košta oko 0,1 ms; 0 preskače prolaz."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Doseg oštrenja, 1 do 4 px: malo = fini detalji, veliko = podebljani rubovi. Promijenite ako je "
"oštrenje presitno ili pregrubo; slika veća od ekrana, kao u VR-u, treba više od 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Oštriji tekst na teksturama (prometni znakovi, nadzorna ploča, GPS). 0 = isklj.; što negativnije, "
"to oštrije, ali ograde više trepere; probajte -0,5 do -1 ako je tekst mutan. Gotovo ništa ne "
"košta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Isto za žičane ograde, travu i lišće: povećajte prema 0 ako ograde trepere, smanjite ako trava "
"izgleda mekano. isto = prati redak iznad. Radi samo kad Oštrina tekstura nije 0. Gotovo ništa ne "
"košta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Žice, ograde i prozori tretiraju se kao ono što je ispred, a ne kao ono što se vidi kroz njih, pa "
"se pri kretanju ne razmazuju. Isključite ako tamo ne vidite razmazivanje: štedi 0,02 - 0,06 ms po "
"oku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Sprječava da sjaj ulične rasvjete i svjetala automobila za sobom ostavlja trag dok se krećete: "
"sjaj se u svakoj sličici crta iznova umjesto miješanja sa starijim sličicama. Koraci od 25 %; "
"smanjite ako sjaj treperi, 0 = isklj. Košta oko 0,05 - 0,2 ms po oku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: samo sredina svakog oka dobiva DLAA (20 do 100 %); rub zadržava sliku igre. Smanjite za teži "
"model ili više fps; 40 % košta oko 40 % modela. Određuje i kamion u garaži / glavnom izborniku."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Kako DLAA obrađuje pokretne dijelove i retrovizore kamiona. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo je "
"zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"DLAA prati svaku pokretnu stvar zasebno (promet, kotače, registarske pločice), pa ostaje oštar i "
"bez tragova. Isključite samo radi uštede od oko 0,5 ms po oku ili za test: tada se sve kreće s "
"kamerom, a promet se razmazuje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Glača i retrovizore kamiona da ne trepere. 1 retrovizor = samo najveći (glavni pokraj vas). svi = "
"svaki retrovizor. kamera = najjeftinije po retrovizoru, vozila u pokretu mogu ostaviti tragove u "
"staklu; ostali načini prate svaku pokretnu stvar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"uklj. = svaki retrovizor dobiva DLAA svaku 2. sličicu, a između prikazuje zadnju čistu sliku: "
"otprilike pola cijene retrovizora. Rubovi ostaju čisti; pokretno u staklu osvježava se upola "
"sporije. isklj. = svaki retrovizor svaku sličicu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Broj sličica i CPU: CPU podešavanje, AMD jezgre s predmemorijom, FPS ograničenje i Mala odgoda "
"(Reflex) za ravni način, FPS ograničenje za VR. Desno otvara skupinu, lijevo je zatvara; pri "
"svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tri CPU prekidača zajedno. Prednost brzim jezgrama: samo Intel procesori s P i E jezgrama. Viši "
"prioritet i bez Windows štednje energije za igru: svaki CPU, Intel i AMD. Pomaže kad je CPU "
"ograničenje; ne košta ništa. Zasebno u dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"AMD X3D procesori s dvije skupine jezgri (7950X3D, 9950X3D): drži igru na jezgrama s velikom 3D "
"V-Cache predmemorijom, koju igre vole. Prebacuje se odmah; isklj. vraća igri sve jezgre. Probajte "
"i usporedite u prometnom gradu. Ne košta ništa."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način. Drži igru najviše na ovom broju sličica: ujednačeno vrijeme sličice, manje "
"topline i struje. Postavite malo ispod onoga što vaše računalo drži u prometnom gradu. Kad je "
"Mala odgoda (Reflex) uključena, ograničava NVIDIA upravljački program. isklj. = bez ograničenja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način, samo NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Uklj. = sličice igre čekaju kraće prije nego ih "
"kartica nacrta: manja odgoda između upravljanja i slike kad je kartica ograničenje. Boost dodatno "
"drži visoke takte kartice. Isti fps; mala cijena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. polovica = igra crta svaku 2. sličicu slušalica (72 Hz -> 36 fps), trećina = svaku 3.; "
"zaglađivanje sličica slušalica (ASW / Motion Smoothing) popunjava ostalo ujednačenim ritmom. "
"Koristite kad fps varira. Dok je uključeno, isključuje Turbo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"VR ubrzanja: Turbo, foveated rendering, preskakanje skrivenih rubova leća i jesu li pronađeni "
"OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Desno otvara skupinu, lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika "
"je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"Turbo isključuje zaglađivanje sličica slušalica (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Samo VR. Uklj. = "
"igra u svakoj sličici ne čeka slušalice: više fps samo kad je CPU ograničenje (prometni gradovi, "
"promet). Isključite ako slika zapinje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Oštro središte, manje detalja na rubu (samo NVIDIA RTX). Štedi GPU vrijeme pri visokom "
"Skaliranju. Samo VR. Vanjski prsten dobiva jednu boju na 2 x 2 piksela; ograde, trava i lišće "
"zadržavaju pun detalj. Isključite ako rub izgleda blokovski."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Koliko je veliko oštro središte Foveated rendering, 10 - 100 % u koracima od 5 %: veće = više "
"slike oštro, manja ušteda; manje = veća ušteda, niži detalji počinju bliže sredini. Zadano je 80 "
"% (uravnoteženo); 90 = široko, 65 = usko."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Što Foveated rendering čini grubljim. scena = samo 3D svijet (zadano). scena + svjetlo = i "
"osvjetljenje igre, samo na samom rubu: veća ušteda. Isprobajte: tražite blokovske rubove svjetla "
"ili sjena sa strane vidnog polja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Koliko je grub vanjski prsten Foveated rendering. Normalno = 1 boja na 2 x 2 piksela (zadano). "
"Jako = na 4 x 2, Maks. = na 4 x 4: veća GPU ušteda, blokovitiji rubovi. Najbolje s praćenjem "
"očiju, gdje nikad ne gledate vanjski prsten."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentalno. Oštro središte Foveated rendering prati vaše oči na slušalicama s praćenjem "
"očiju (na primjer Varjo); bez toga središte ostaje na sredini leće. Treba uključeno Foveated "
"rendering pri pokretanju igre, inače ponovno pokretanje. Gotovo ništa ne košta."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Igra preskače kutove leća koje nikad ne vidite (slušalice ih javljaju), pa crta manje "
"piksela: više GPU rezerve, slika ostaje ista. Prvo uključivanje traži restart igre. Isključite "
"ako rub pogleda izgleda pogrešno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR generiranje sličica od djules75, zasebno preuzimanje "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). pronađen = njegov sloj je učitan u ovoj igri i mod propušta "
"njegov rad. Pokrenite njegovu tray aplikaciju prije igre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = OpenXR paket poboljšanja od DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, Depth, "
"generiranje sličica; pronađen = njegov sloj je učitan u igri i mod propušta njegov rad. Pokrenite "
"samo jedan Turbo (njegov ili moda)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Gdje lebdi vlastito VR sučelje igre (HUD, izbornici). Mod upisuje promjenu u konzolu igre umjesto "
"vas; treba g_developer i g_console 1 u config.cfg. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo je zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Koji od rasporeda VR sučelja igre pomiču redovi ispod: vožnja (HUD tijekom vožnje) ili izbornici "
"(zasloni izbornika igre)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče VR sučelje igre: visinu, stranu, udaljenost, nagib, okret, veličinu ili zakrivljenost, u "
"malim koracima. Igra dobiva svaku promjenu oko 0,4 s nakon vašeg zadnjeg pritiska: konzola se "
"sama otvara i zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Desno: sve vrijednosti oba rasporeda vraćaju se na ono što je config.cfg imao na početku (igra "
"sprema vlastite vrijednosti pri izlasku)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Mali prozor uživo s fps-om i vremenom sličice, i kad je izbornik zatvoren (ravni način i VR): "
"fps, ms, samo brojke, svaka sa ili bez grafa nedavnih vremena sličica (skokovi su crveni), ili "
"samo graf. Njegova GPU cijena se mjeri. Spremanje ga zadržava."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Zaključavanje, položaj, veličina, boja, VR udaljenost i okretanje FPS okvira. Desno otvara "
"skupinu, Lijevo je zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče FPS okvir u stranu, u % ekrana (VR fixed / attached: stupnjevi oko vas). Ravno i VR pamte "
"svaki svoj položaj. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče FPS okvir gore / dolje, u % ekrana (VR fixed / attached: stupnjevi, minus = gore). Ravno i "
"VR pamte svaki svoj položaj. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Povećava ili smanjuje FPS okvir (0,2 .. 3,0). Povećajte ako ga ne možete čitati u slušalicama ili "
"na velikom ekranu. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Boja teksta FPS okvira: 20 boja, svaka s obrubom da se čita na svakoj slici (crno na bijelom = "
"tamni tekst, bijeli obrub). Ravno i VR. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Svjetlina FPS okvira, 10 - 100 %: 100 = boja kakva jest, niže zatamnjuje tekst (obrub ostaje) "
"prema crnoj. Koristite za utišavanje brojača noću ili u slušalicama. Ravno i VR. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Prozirnost cijelog FPS okvira, 10 - 100 %: 100 = puno, niže blijedi tekst I crni obrub zajedno, "
"pa zatamnjeni okvir ne postaje crna mrlja. Ravno i VR. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Koliko unatrag sežu FPS graf: 2 - 60 s. Jedan stupac po odsječku vremena = njegova najsporija "
"sličica, pa se vide skokovi. Zeleno = na vrijeme, žuto = malo sporo, crveno = zastoj; crta = "
"brzina slušalica / FPS ograničenje / vaša uobičajena. Prikazano kad FPS brojač ima graf."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Prati glavu = kreće se sa slušalicama. Fiksno u prostoru = jedno mjesto oko vašeg "
"sjedala, ignorira ljuljanje kabine. Zalijepljeno na vozilo = zalijepljeno za kabinu, ljulja se s "
"njom (treba DLAA + Prati pokretne dijelove). Ne košta ništa."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, Zalijepljeno na vozilo. Uklj. = svaki kamion / auto pamti svoje mjesto FPS okvira u "
"kabini, okretanje, veličinu, boju, svjetlinu i tekst (sprema se u dlaa.ini pri zatvaranju "
"izbornika). Isklj. = jedan zajednički skup za sva vozila. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, Zalijepljeno na vozilo. Desno = ponovno izmjeri kabinu sada (mirno sjedite, parkirano) "
"ako okvir ne stoji dobro. Lijevo = okvir ovog vozila na zadano (mjesto, okretanje, veličina, "
"boja, tekst); druga vozila zadržavaju svoje. Okvir je pravokutan na kabinu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Okreće FPS okvir ulijevo / udesno oko sebe, u stupnjevima (+ = lice se "
"okreće udesno). Koristite za nagib okvira kad je sa strane. 0 = gleda prema vama. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Naginje FPS okvir, u stupnjevima (+ = gornji rub se naginje od vas, "
"kao da leži na instrument ploči). 0 = gleda prema vama. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Rotira FPS okvir u njegovoj ravnini, u stupnjevima (+ = u smjeru "
"kazaljke). 0 = uspravno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Koliko daleko FPS okvir lebdi, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Zadržava istu veličinu u "
"vašem pogledu na svakoj udaljenosti; mijenja se samo dubina. Stavite ga blizu dubine na koju "
"gledate da ga čitate bez ponovnog fokusiranja. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Položaj, veličina, dubina i okrenutost panela te tipke izbornika. Desno otvara skupinu, Lijevo je "
"zatvara; pri svakom otvaranju izbornika je zatvorena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče panel u stranu, u % ekrana (VR fixed in cab: stupnjevi oko sjedala). Ravno i VR pamte "
"svaki svoj položaj. Koristite ako panel zaklanja nešto važno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Pomiče panel gore / dolje, u % ekrana (VR fixed in cab: stupnjevi, plus = dolje). Ravno i VR "
"pamte svaki svoj položaj. Koristite ako panel zaklanja nešto važno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Povećava ili smanjuje panel. Povećajte ako ga ne možete čitati, smanjite ako zaklanja previše. "
"Ravno i VR pamte svaki svoju veličinu. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR. Prati glavu = panel se kreće sa slušalicama. Fiksno u kabini = ostaje na jednom mjestu "
"ispred sjedala, miran dok gledate uokolo; X / Y / depth tada određuju to mjesto (stupnjevi, "
"metri). Treba VR sloj (zadano). Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Koliko daleko panel lebdi: u metrima (0,30 - 3,00) kao VR sloj, "
"zadano; u px pomaka prema unutra po oku uz menu_vr_layer = 0. Ista veličina na svakoj dubini. "
"Promijenite ako je gledanje panela zamorno. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Samo VR, pa u ravnom sivo. Uklj. = panel se okreće prema vama kad ga pomaknete u stranu, ista "
"veličina iz svakog kuta (kao VR sloj, zadano, i FPS okvir koji prati glavu); isklj. = ravna "
"slika. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Prekidači za usporedbu: DLAA isklj., vlastiti TAA igre primiješan ili uz bok, ispravci žica, "
"ranije pokretanje DLAA. Ništa od toga nije potrebno za normalnu vožnju. Desno otvara skupinu, "
"lijevo je zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje ili isključuje cijeli mod i pamti način rada; isklj. prikazuje izvornu sliku igre, za "
"usporedbu. Isključeno štedi cijenu svih dijelova zajedno."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"uključeno = mod lijevo, TAA same igre desno, za usporedbu (Položaj crte podjele, Podjela: lijevo "
"| desno). Zamjenjuje Miks dok je uključeno. Kad je konzola igre uključena, mod umjesto vas "
"mijenja izglađivanje igre."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Gdje je crta podjele, 0 - 100 % širine u koracima od 5 %: lijevo od nje DLAA / DLSS moda, desno "
"TAA igre. Koristi se samo dok je Podjela s TAA-om igre uključena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Što podjela prikazuje na svojim dvjema stranama: DLAA | TAA (mod lijevo, TAA igre desno), miks | "
"TAA ili DLAA | miks (miks = to dvoje pomiješano prema Količini miksa). DLSS umjesto DLAA pri "
"povećavanju. Koristi se samo dok je Podjela s TAA-om igre uključena."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice se pri vožnji kreću ispravno: njihov se pokret raširi po cijeloj tankoj liniji. uklj. "
"= zadano. isklj. = samo za usporedbu; bliske žice više trepere. Slika je trenutak mekana nakon "
"prebacivanja."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tanke žice računaju se kao ispred na svakom pikselu koji dodirnu, čak i kad ga pokrivaju samo "
"djelić. uklj. = zadano. uklj. (bez A2C) = i za prozirne rubove poput lišća. isklj. = samo za "
"usporedbu; bliske žice više trepere."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentalno: crta daleke žice tanje od 1 piksela kao liniju od 1 piksela, da se ne raspadaju "
"u crtice. Zadano isključeno: daleke žice mogu izgledati tamnije ili jače treperiti. Isprobajte i "
"usporedite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Samo ravni način: DLAA radi prije nego igra doda sjaj i izgled boja, pa boja na cesti, žice i "
"tračnice manje trepere. Mijenjajte samo za usporedbu. Ne koristi se uz DLSS skaliranje ni Windows "
"HDR. Ista cijena; prebacivanje traje oko sekunde."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Prijava greške: dvaput pritisnite tipku snimanja (ili Snimi sada) tamo gdje nešto izgleda krivo; "
"mod zapisuje jedan zip koji priložite prijavi na GitHubu. Desno otvara skupinu, lijevo je zatvara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Jedan prekidač za najcjelovitiji izvještaj: razina zapisa debug, premotavanje 2 s, snimka Puna. "
"Isklj. vraća retke kako su bili. Sprema se samo ovaj prekidač; prisilne vrijednosti se nikad ne "
"zapisuju u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Što ide u dlaa_inject.log: isklj. = ništa; greške = samo kvarovi (zadano); upozorenja = + "
"zaobiđeni problemi; informacije = + pokretanje i promjene; dijagnostika = + statistika i mjerenja "
"vremena (malo sporije)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Stalno drži zadnjih 0,5 - 3 s sličica na grafičkoj kartici, pa izvještaj pokazuje trenutak PRIJE "
"tipke (+ što je DLSS dobio u zadnjim sličicama). Košta grafičku memoriju (MB u stupcu cijene) i "
"kopiju slike po sličici. isklj. = ništa."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Brza = podaci o sustavu, zapisi, postavke, vaša slika i DLAA isklj. na nekoliko sličica (oko 1 "
"s). Puna = + što je DLSS dobio po sličici (boja, pokret, dubina) i A/B skupovi: prikaz pokreta, "
"pokret isklj., samo jitter (oko 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"Tipka snimanja. Pritisnite je DVAPUT unutar 1 s tijekom vožnje tamo gdje nešto ne valja (prvi "
"pritisak je samo priprema: jedan kratki zvuk). Desno otvara stranicu Prečaca na njezinu retku, "
"gdje je možete promijeniti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Koliko snimaka ostaje u mapi dlaa_selftest pokraj DLL-a: starije (mapa + zip) brišu se kad "
"nastane nova. sve = nikad ne briši."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Jezik ovog izbornika. auto = jezik igre (zadano); Lijevo / Desno bira drugi. Linux / Proton: "
"kineski, japanski i korejski traže instalirane fontove, vidi README. Datoteka lang\\<code>.po uz "
"DLL ima prednost, za vaše ispravke. Spremi u dlaa.ini ga pamti. Bez cijene."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Sve tipke ovog izbornika, jedan redak po radnji, s tipkom na tipkovnici i gumbom kontrolera. "
"Desno otvara popis; odaberite radnju s Desno, zatim pritisnite novu tipku ili gumb na volanu. "
"Odmah se sprema u dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Zapisuje sve prikazano ovdje u dlaa.ini (postavke te položaje panela / FPS okvira kad ste ih "
"pomaknuli), zadržavajući sve ostale retke. Učinite to kad vam se sviđa što vidite, inače se "
"promjene gube pri sljedećem pokretanju. Način se sprema sam."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Vraća svaku postavku u ovom izborniku na stanje u kojem mod dolazi (model, oštrenje, oštrina "
"tekstura, DLAA područje, pokret, retrovizori, predložak, ploča, fps prozor, turbo, foveated, broj "
"sličica, CPU, razina zapisa), uživo i u dlaa.ini, a zadržava vaše prečace i sve ostale retke."

