#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = snimi sada (izbornik se prvo zatvara). Zip (mapa dlaa_selftest pokraj DLL-a) sadrži podatke "
"o sustavu, zapis moda i igre, dlaa.ini, vašu sliku i DLAA isklj.; Puna dodaje što je DLSS dobio i "
"A/B skupove; premotavanje dodaje trenutak prije. Vaše korisničko ime i matična mapa se uklanjaju. "
"%ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"5 tipki koje otvaraju i upravljaju ovim izbornikom: %hs otvara / zatvara (vrijednost), %hs / %hs "
"/ %hs / %hs pomiču (stupac Tipka). Dok je izbornik otvoren, igri se uskraćuje samo ovih 5. %hs: "
"mijenjajte ih na stranici Prečaci."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Zatvara izbornik; 5 tipki izbornika vraća se igri. %hs radi isto iz bilo kojeg retka."

